================================================================================
## Redirect domain load to Domain → General
================================================================================

Context:
Loading a domain from Home or the navbar Load dialog left the user on the
homepage. The session and top menus updated, but the page never opened
Domain → General. Generic load paths now navigate to
`/domain/?section=information`. Intentional Validation/Publication jumps
are unchanged.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js
   Added `navigateToDomainGeneral()` and used it after Load from Registry
   and after domain import, instead of `location.reload()`.
2. src/front/static/home/js/home.js
   Home gateway Open now lands on Domain → General.
3. src/front/static/registry/js/registry.js
   Registry Load navigates to Domain → General instead of reloading Browse.
4. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-versions.js
   Loading or reloading a version opens Domain → General.
5. tests/units/front/test_navbar_domain_badge_persistence.py
   Badge refresh still runs before navigation; load no longer reloads the
   current page.
6. tests/units/front/test_domain_load_redirect.py
   Source contracts for Home, Registry, and Versions load navigation.

Modified files:
- src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js
- src/front/static/home/js/home.js
- src/front/static/registry/js/registry.js
- src/front/static/domain/js/domain-versions.js
- tests/units/front/test_navbar_domain_badge_persistence.py
